  "releaseNotes": "- M3ButtonGroup: New core component for Action, Single-select, and Multiple-select clustering.\n- Responsive Gaps: Integrated device-aware spacing (18px XS to 8px Desktop) for button groups.\n- Visual Synchronicity: Aligned button group rounding and gaps with SplitButton specifications.\n- Padding Fixes: Resolved horizontal alignment issues for buttons with leading icons.\n- M3SearchBar: Integrated the official search bar component into the core site navigation.",
